      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name} So some good news and bad news. Good news: with Beta 4, the erratic snapping is gone with the setting ticked on and the constrained object seems to follow the intended behavior. Bad News: The setting seems to mess with the transform values when applied as it no longer has it's initial offset and sets it's transform to 0's on all axis. This seems to only apply when the setting is ticked on and actively resets when ticked off (See gif)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
